<div  class="section-wrapper plumbing-wrapper" id="commercial-flower-grower">

    <!-- IMAGE -->
    <div class="plumbing-image-box">
      <div class="dots"></div>
      <img src="/services/flower-commerical.png" class="section-img" alt="Skyrise Protect" data-aos="fade-right">
    </div>

    <!-- TEXT -->
    <div class="plumbing-content">
      <h2 class="section-title section-title reveal-letters">Commercial Flower Grower<br>– Pump Room Upgrade</h2>
      <p class="section-text" data-aos="fade-up">
        We completed the design and installation of a new pump room for an expanding commercial flower grower,
        delivering a robust, fully automated water infrastructure solution. The project included the installation of new pumps, 
        a full electrical package, and an upgrade of the main switchboard to ensure current compliance. Advanced timers, controllers, dosing units, 
        and full automation with remote monitoring were integrated to provide seamless operation and control.The system was designed with practicality, 
        versatility, and redundancy in mind, eliminating single points of failure and ensuring the client’s business is never without water. 
        This upgrade provides long-term reliability, operational confidence, and scalability to support ongoing growth—another successful installation 
        delivered to a high commercial standard.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>


  <div class="section-wrapper right-image-wrapper"  id="rooftop-waterproofing">

    <!-- IMAGE -->
    <div class="service-image-box" data-aos="fade-right">
      <div class="dots"></div>
      <img src="/services/roof-waterproof.png" class="section-img" alt="Commercial Metal Roofing" data-aos="fade-right">
    </div>

    <!-- TEXT -->
    <div class="service-content">
      <h2 class="section-title section-title reveal-letters">Rooftop<br>Waterproofing Services</h2>
      <p class="section-text" data-aos="fade-up">We provide professional rooftop waterproofing services for commercial, residential, and strata buildings, including concrete rooftops on high-rise buildings, apartment complexes, and multi-unit developments. Our service is designed to prevent water ingress, protect structural elements, and extend the service life of exposed rooftop surfaces.
As part of our waterproofing offering, we utilise the Skyrise Protect system, a high-performance waterproofing and protective coating suitable for concrete roof slabs and other exposed rooftop substrates. 
<br>This system forms a seamless, durable barrier that protects against water penetration, UV exposure, thermal movement, and ongoing weather exposure.
Our rooftop waterproofing service is suitable for flat and low-slope concrete roofs, plant room roofs, podium slabs, and rooftop areas subject to foot traffic or equipment loading. All flooring installations carried out as part of this service are backed by a 20-year warranty, providing long-term assurance of performance and workmanship.
This service is suitable for both remedial waterproofing works and preventative maintenance, offering a reliable, long-term solution for buildings experiencing leaks, deterioration, or age-related roof failure.
